silm:instances_papers_21_ologs_and_typed_english_chapters_08_cross_paper_bridges_sections_01_bridge_to_19_mereology_as_colimit_concrete_anchor_3_part_box#headpartbox silm:hasLongDescription "The HeadPartBox is a paper-21 typed-noun box whose paper-19 reading is a colimit-diagram object. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'part_box', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
